  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The GEF financed project (Grant: USD 4,000,000; Co-financing: USD 23,622,457), implemented by the Ministry of Environment and Energy (MINAE) with support of the United Nations Development Programme (UNDP), aims to reduce the emissions/releases, minimize exposure of human beings to UPOPs in strategic sectors including plastics and to advance the Stockholm Convention through the promotion of Circular Economy in Costa Rica.The project is structured in in four components and the following main outco</narrative>
